# .CT-Files-Translator-to-English
CT File Translator is an automated tool that translates .ct files into English
PrerequisitesTo prevent execution errors: make sure you have the following:Python 3.x installed on your system.A dedicated folder containing both Translate.py and your .ct file 

when you have that just execute Translate.py and wait until its done when its done it will created a english .CT file in the same folder
